{"format":1,"id":"supportive-14","version":"8c07ec37817f","title":"I Will Still Come","shortTitle":"I Will Still Come","number":14,"sources":[{"title":"Super Supportive — Sleyca","url":"https://www.royalroad.com/fiction/63759/super-supportive","note":"User-supplied EPUB, SIX: Gorgon. From It was an embarrassing admission. through the trial-and-error agreement, before the lobby doors open. Simplified Mandarin adaptation; choices vary local intention without changing canonical events."}],"notice":"This episode adapts Super Supportive by Sleyca. Conversations are simplified for Mandarin reading, and choices vary your response while preserving the story’s events.","entry":0,"nodes":[{"type":"line","speaker":"Alden","scene":"lobby","phrases":[{"py":"wǒ kuài shí liù suì le，","en":"I'm nearly sixteen,"},{"py":"hái xiǎng dé dào chāo néng lì。","en":"and still want superpowers."},{"py":"zài tā miàn qián shuō zhè xiē，","en":"In front of him, saying these things"},{"py":"zhēn de yǒu diǎn bù hǎo yì si。","en":"really feels a little embarrassing."}]},{"type":"reaction","actor":"Alden","emotion":"embarrassed","scene":"lobby"},{"type":"line","speaker":"Gorgon","scene":"lobby","phrases":[{"py":"suǒ yǐ，","en":"So,"},{"py":"nǐ hěn huì xiǎng。","en":"you have quite an imagination."},{"py":"rén kě bù zhī dào","en":"Humans certainly don't know"},{"py":"xì tǒng huì xuǎn zé shuí。","en":"whom the System will choose."}]},{"type":"animation","id":"gorgon-listen"},{"type":"line","speaker":"Alden","scene":"lobby","phrases":[{"py":"wǒ yǐ qián shuō de nà ge rén，","en":"The person I mentioned before,"},{"py":"tā zì jǐ","en":"she herself"},{"py":"yě yǒu chāo néng lì。","en":"also has superpowers."}]},{"type":"reaction","actor":"Alden","emotion":"talking","scene":"lobby"},{"type":"line","speaker":"Gorgon","scene":"lobby","phrases":[{"py":"tā duì nǐ de shēn tǐ","en":"To your body,"},{"py":"zuò guo shén me hěn bù hǎo de shì ma？","en":"did she do anything very wrong?"},{"py":"méi yǒu de huà，","en":"If not