nk about"},{"py":"wèi shén me bù yí yàng。","en":"why I'm different."}],"to":16},{"id":"warning","phrases":[{"py":"jì zhù tā shuō de，","en":"Remember what she said:"},{"py":"bù yí dìng。","en":"it's not certain."}],"to":18}]},{"type":"line","speaker":"Alden","scene":"lobby","phrases":[{"py":"nà me duō rén lǐ，","en":"Among so many people,"},{"py":"zhǐ yǒu wǒ men sì gè。","en":"only the four of us."},{"py":"wǒ dāng rán huì xiǎng，","en":"Of course I would wonder"},{"py":"zì jǐ shì bu shì yě yǒu kě néng。","en":"whether I have a chance too."}]},{"type":"goto","to":19},{"type":"line","speaker":"Alden","scene":"lobby","phrases":[{"py":"tā méi yǒu shuō","en":"She didn't say"},{"py":"wǒ yí dìng huì bèi xuǎn zé。","en":"I would definitely be chosen."},{"py":"wǒ bù néng zhǐ tīng","en":"I can't listen only to"},{"py":"zì jǐ xiǎng tīng de huà。","en":"what I want to hear."}]},{"type":"line","speaker":"Alden","scene":"lobby","phrases":[{"py":"tā jué de，","en":"She thought,"},{"py":"wǒ shēn tǐ lǐ","en":"within my body,"},{"py":"kě néng yǒu yì zhǒng","en":"there might be a kind of"},{"py":"tè bié de lì liàng。","en":"unusual power."},{"py":"míng zi jiào hùn dùn qián néng。","en":"It's called chaos potential."}]},{"type":"reaction","actor":"Alden","emotion":"curious","scene":"lobby"},{"type":"line","speaker":"Alden","scene":"lobby","phrases":[{"py":"zhè zhǒng lì liàng gāo de rén，","en":"People with a high level of this power,"},{"py":"bèi xì tǒng xuǎn zé de kě néng","en":"their chance of being chosen by the System"},{"py":"yě gāo。","en":"is higher too."},{"py":"kě shì，","en":"But,"},{"py":"zhè zhǐ shì yì zhǒng xiǎng fǎ，","en":"this is only an idea,"},{"py":"wǒ men hái bù zhī dào","en":"and we still don't know"},{"py":"shì bu shì zhè yàng。","en":"whether it's really so."}]},{"type":"reaction","actor":"Alden","emotion":"thoughtful","scene":"lobby"},{"type":"line","speaker":"Alden","scene":"lobby","phrases":[{"py":"yǒu chāo néng lì de rén de hái zi，","en":"Children of people with superpowers"